@startuml sequence_27_food_tour
skinparam backgroundColor White
skinparam sequenceFontSize 11
skinparam sequenceFontName "Times New Roman"
skinparam lifelineStrategy nosolid

actor Admin
actor User
participant "AdminDashboard" as AdminFE
participant "MapPage" as MapFE
participant "AdminToursController" as AdminCtrl
participant "ToursController" as PublicCtrl
participant "MySqlAdminRepository" as Repo
database "MySQL\ntours, tour_steps, pois" as DB

Admin -> AdminFE: Tao/Sua Food Tour
AdminFE -> AdminCtrl: POST/PUT /api/admin/food-tours\n{ title, description, category, steps }
AdminCtrl -> AdminCtrl: Validate title,\nsteps khong rong, order/POI khong trung
AdminCtrl -> Repo: Create/UpdateFoodTourAsync(tour)
Repo -> DB: INSERT/UPDATE tours
Repo -> DB: DELETE/INSERT tour_steps theo thu tu
DB --> Repo: OK
Repo --> AdminCtrl: OK
AdminCtrl --> AdminFE: 201 Created hoac 204 NoContent
AdminFE --> Admin: Cap nhat bang Food Tours

User -> MapFE: Mo trang ban do
MapFE -> PublicCtrl: GET /api/tours
PublicCtrl -> Repo: GetFoodToursAsync()
Repo -> DB: SELECT tours + tour_steps
DB --> Repo: Danh sach tour
Repo --> PublicCtrl: List<FoodTour>
PublicCtrl --> MapFE: 200 OK
MapFE --> User: Hien thi bo chon Food Tour

User -> MapFE: Chon mot tour
MapFE -> MapFE: Sap xep POI theo steps\nva loc danh sach hien thi
MapFE --> User: Hien thi marker/card theo tour

@enduml
